description:
Integrate TimeProvider with channel selection for GNSS-synchronized hopping.

## Files
- rust/lichen-link/src/channel.rs or rust/lichen-node/src/channel.rs

## Changes

### Add sync_hop_channel function
```rust
/// Select channel using GNSS-synchronized hopping.
/// Falls back to epoch-based when GNSS unavailable.
#[cfg(feature = "sync-hop")]
pub fn sync_hop_channel<T: TimeProvider>(
    time_provider: &T,
    seed: u32,
    n_channels: u8,
    superframe_ms: u32,
    epoch_base_ms: u64,
    fallback_epoch: u32,
    fallback_eui64: &[u8; 8],
) -> u8 {
    if time_provider.has_gnss() {
        if let Some(unix_ms) = time_provider.unix_time_ms() {
            let sfn = sfn_from_unix_ms(unix_ms, superframe_ms, epoch_base_ms);
            return synchronized_hop_channel(sfn, seed, n_channels);
        }
    }
    // Fallback to epoch-based
    epoch_based_channel(fallback_eui64, fallback_epoch, n_channels)
}
```

## Feature Flag
- Add `sync-hop` feature to relevant Cargo.toml files
- Gate all new code behind `#[cfg(feature = "sync-hop")]`

